  "result": "I fixed all three digest problems. The type-check passes, but I did not run the test suite.\n\n1. **Opt-in only:** `listDigestSubscribers` in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts` now returns only users who have at least one preference with `digestOnly` set to true in that workspace. Changing other notification settings no longer subscribes anyone.\n2. **Most recent updates, newest first:** `buildDigest` in `src/server/services/digest-service.ts` now sorts the unread updates newest first before applying the `DIGEST_MAX_ENTRIES` cap. The cap now drops the oldest updates, and the email's headline is the most recent one.\n3. **Archived workspaces:** `buildDigest` and `runDigestEmailJob` (`src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts`) both skip a workspace whose `archivedAt` is set, so an archived workspace sends no digest. Live workspaces behave as before.",
